{"id":13009,"slug":"13009-phan-biet-3-cach-duyet-cay-nhi-phan-preorder-inorder-postorder","category":"DSA","subcategory":"Tree","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Phân biệt 3 cách duyệt cây nhị phân: preorder, inorder, postorder?","question_en":"Difference between preorder, inorder, postorder tree traversal?","answer_vi":"Cùng DFS, chỉ khác **thứ tự thăm node** vs **đệ quy con**.\n\n**Preorder (NLR):** Node → Left → Right\n```ts\nfunction preorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  visit(node)              // 1. Thăm node trước\n  preorder(node.left)      // 2. Rồi đi trái\n  preorder(node.right)     // 3. Cuối đi phải\n}\n```\n→ Dùng để **clone cây** hoặc serialize.\n\n**Inorder (LNR):** Left → Node → Right\n```ts\nfunction inorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  inorder(node.left)\n  visit(node)\n  inorder(node.right)\n}\n```\n→ Trên BST cho ra **sorted order**.\n\n**Postorder (LRN):** Left → Right → Node\n```ts\nfunction postorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  postorder(node.left)\n  postorder(node.right)\n  visit(node)\n}\n```\n→ Dùng để **delete cây** hoặc tính giá trị bottom-up (height, sum).","answer_en":"All three are DFS; they differ only in **when the node is visited** relative to the recursive calls.\n\n**Preorder (NLR):** Node → Left → Right\n```ts\nfunction preorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  visit(node)              // 1. visit the node first\n  preorder(node.left)      // 2. then go left\n  preorder(node.right)     // 3. finally go right\n}\n```\n→ Use it to **clone a tree** or serialize it.\n\n**Inorder (LNR):** Left → Node → Right\n```ts\nfunction inorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  inorder(node.left)\n  visit(node)\n  inorder(node.right)\n}\n```\n→ On a BST this yields **sorted order**.\n\n**Postorder (LRN):** Left → Right → Node\n```ts\nfunction postorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  postorder(node.left)\n  postorder(node.right)\n  visit(node)\n}\n```\n→ Use it to **delete a tree** or compute bottom-up values (height, sum).","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Cùng DFS, chỉ khác <strong>thứ tự thăm node</strong> vs <strong>đệ quy con</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Preorder (NLR):</strong> Node → Left → Right</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function preorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  visit(node)              // 1. Thăm node trước\n  preorder(node.left)      // 2. Rồi đi trái\n  preorder(node.right)     // 3. Cuối đi phải\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">node</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">visit</span>(node)              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. Thăm node trước</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">left</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. Rồi đi trái</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">right</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3. Cuối đi phải</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">→ Dùng để <strong>clone cây</strong> hoặc serialize.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Inorder (LNR):</strong> Left → Node → Right</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function inorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  inorder(node.left)\n  visit(node)\n  inorder(node.right)\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inorder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">node</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">left</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">visit</span>(node)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">right</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">→ Trên BST cho ra <strong>sorted order</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Postorder (LRN):</strong> Left → Right → Node</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function postorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  postorder(node.left)\n  postorder(node.right)\n  visit(node)\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">node</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">left</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">right</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">visit</span>(node)\n}</code></pre></div><p>→ Dùng để <strong>delete cây</strong> hoặc tính giá trị bottom-up (height, sum).</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">All three are DFS; they differ only in <strong>when the node is visited</strong> relative to the recursive calls.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Preorder (NLR):</strong> Node → Left → Right</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function preorder(node) {\n  if (!node) return\n  visit(node)              // 1. visit the node first\n  preorder(node.left)      // 2. then go left\n  preorder(node.right)     // 3. finally go right\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">node</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">visit</span>(node)              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. visit the node first</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">left</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. then go left</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">right</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3. finally go right</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">→ Use it to <strong>clone a tree</strong> or serialize it.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Inorder (LNR):</strong> Left → Node → Right</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-