rentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">node</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">left</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">postorder</span>(node.<span class=\"hljs-property\">right</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">visit</span>(node)\n}</code></pre></div><p>→ Use it to <strong>delete a tree</strong> or compute bottom-up values (height, sum).</p>","references":[{"label":"NeetCode — Trees","url":"https://neetcode.io/roadmap"},{"label":"LeetCode — Binary Tree Inorder Traversal","url":"https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-tree-inorder-traversal/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/13001-khi-nao-nen-dung-hash-map-thay-vi-duyet-mang","title":"Khi nào nên dùng Hash Map thay vì duyệt mảng?"},{"url":"/q/13002-khi-nao-dung-sliding-window-phan-biet-fixed-size-va-variable-size","title":"Khi nào dùng Sliding Window? Phân biệt fixed-size và variable-size?"},{"url":"/q/13003-khi-nao-dung-two-pointers-thay-vi-hash-map-cho-bai-tim-cap","title":"Khi nào dùng Two Pointers thay vì Hash Map cho bài tìm cặp?"},{"url":"/q/13004-off-by-one-trong-binary-search-dung-left-right-hay-left-right","title":"Off-by-one trong Binary Search: dùng `left < right` hay `left <= right`?"},{"url":"/q/13005-khi-nao-dung-bfs-khi-nao-dfs","title":"Khi nào dùng BFS, khi nào DFS?"},{"url":"/q/13006-big-o-la-gi-tai-sao-o-2n-lai-viet-la-o-n","title":"Big-O là gì? Tại sao O(2n) lại viết là O(n)?"},{"url":"/q/13007-quy-hoach-dong-1-chieu-khi-nao-dung-va-sao-biet-duoc","title":"Quy hoạch động 1 chiều — Khi nào dùng và sao biết được?"},{"url":"/q/13008-backtracking-khi-nao-dung-va-sao-phan-biet-voi-dp","title":"Backtracking — Khi nào dùng và sao phân biệt với DP?"}]}